{"id":"largement","lemma":"largement","pos":"adv","rank":4277,"glosses":["mainly; mostly"],"ipa":"/laʁ.ʒə.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/Fr-largement.ogg/Fr-largement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Nous avons largement le temps.","en":"We have plenty of time.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Nous avons largement assez de nourriture.","en":"We have ample food.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"to a sufficient or…"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"food, nourishment"}]},{"text":"Son nom devenait largement connu.","en":"His name was becoming widely known.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"name"},{"g":"to become","l":"devenir"},null,{"g":"known"}]},{"text":"Je pense que nous avons encore largement le temps.","en":"I think we still have plenty of time.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"still"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Ça devrait largement suffire.","en":"This should be plenty.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},null,{"g":"to be enough"}]}]}